            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Hanying",
            "A human?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "We haven't met a single human since we entered this mountain.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And one appears exactly when we find ourselves lost... What are the odds, huh? What do you think?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "This could very well be a trap set up by \"The Cradle\".",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "But we've been going in circles on this mountain for a while without any lead.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "So are we going to give it a try now even if it's bait?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "You cannot get your hands on a tiger cub without entering the tiger's den.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "I don't quite understand that \"Kowloong saying,\" but... Alright.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "I'll leave the talking to you. I still find it difficult to interact with humans.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            2,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500629,
            7,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            2,
            500641,
            "",
            400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "Yet in the midst of their discussion, the hunchbacked old man walks straight past Spooner and Hanying as if he cannot see them."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Sir?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "???",
            "Oh, oh! My apologies, my ears and eyes are failing me...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "I'm Mi Ku. Nice to meet you two.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Do you live on this mountain?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "You could say that. It's just a mountain with a tattered temple.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Could you tell us what exactly happened here? Do you know anything about \"The Cradle\"?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And have you seen a little girl...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "You sure have a lot of questions. Take it easy.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The old man brushes off some dirt on a rock nearby and leans against it."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "We're still a distance away from the top of the mountain. It wouldn't hurt to take a break here.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500490,
            4,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "Spooner grows alarmed hearing the old man's words."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Wait... how did you know we were heading to the peak?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "I don't suppose my guess was wrong, though?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "That's where people go when they visit the mountain, and it's been that way since only heaven knows when.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "You have no reason to believe me, but I'll answer whatever questions you might have.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "...Well, here you go, Hanying. I'll be hanging around for recon. Hit me up if you ever need anything.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And people from Kowloong... sure have an interesting way with words.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Casting a look at Hanying, Spooner steps over to the other side of the passage."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500629,
            12,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Mi Ku",
            "Hanying? That's a great name indeed. Now, let's see...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 61,
        "ActionId": 61,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "What happened here up the mountain exactly? We haven't run into anyone but you the entire way coming up.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 62,
        "ActionId": 62,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Well, let's just say some people showed up here uninvited.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 63,
        "ActionId": 63,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And I suppose that's \"The Cradle\"?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 64,
        "ActionId": 64,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Correct. They came a few decades ago and took over the mountain temple.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 65,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "The mountain temple had always been here, except they showed up—and I suppose the mountain temple will still be here in a few years when they're gone.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "You seem quite familiar with them.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Well, I've learned a few things here over the years as a janitor.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "And what I just told you, I learned them from people.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Is there anyone else here?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Nope. All long gone.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "...I was just wondering if you'd ever seen a kid here, about 15 to 16 years old, wearing a white cape.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "I... don't think that's someone I'd describe as a kid.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            7
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 74,
        "ActionId": 74,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And I suppose you've seen her, then?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 75,
        "ActionId": 75,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "I saw her a while back when she passed by in a rush leading a group of people.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 76,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Looking like a boss carrying a giant axe and all. Pretty sure that was her.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Says Mi Ku—as he points at the passage just behind the cliff."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "...And I'm sure that was her because she was just like you.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Like me?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Right—in that you're both trapped in the dark and throwing yourselves at fire.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "People are after the delusional wishes that \"The Cradle\" created, and the girl is after the delusional consequences \"The Cradle\" left in its wake.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "And you're no different...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "But I didn't come seeking any \"delusion,\" though.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Is she whom you really came looking for?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Sticking his hand into the shade of the tree by a rock, Mi Ku comes up with an apple."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Have you any idea why this mountain is called Mt. Huaiwu?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "I... have no idea.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 91,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "The mountain didn't use to go by that name—until a little over a millennium ago when a poet by the name of Householder Changwu passed away here.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 92,
        "ActionId": 92,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Legend has it that she was just passing by when decided that this was where she was going to end her life.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 93,
        "ActionId": 93,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "And so the mountain was named after her.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 94,
        "ActionId": 94,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "But a name is just a name.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 95,
        "ActionId": 95,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "What matters is what lies beneath.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 96,
        "ActionId": 96,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            17
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 97,
        "ActionId": 97,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Could you... shed some light on that?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 98,
        "ActionId": 98,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "There are things that even mankind struggles to wrap our heads around, and it'd be unreasonable to ask robots to do the same.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 99,
        "ActionId": 99,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Still, be it humans or mechanoids, we're all emotional beings that belong to the world.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 100,
        "ActionId": 100,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "So there will come a day when we understand things that we once struggled to understand.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 101,
        "ActionId": 101,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Strange how there isn't a single apple tree here up on this mountain, no?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 102,
        "ActionId": 102,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With it, the man passes the apple in his hand to Hanying."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 103,
        "ActionId": 103,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 104,
        "ActionId": 104,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "I'm sure it's tasty.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 105,
        "ActionId": 105,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Of course. It's fleshy, soft, and sweet.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 106,
        "ActionId": 106,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 107,
        "ActionId": 107,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "But... is this really an apple?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 108,
        "ActionId": 108,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "It could be—well, it still is, at the very least.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 109,
        "ActionId": 109,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Looking every bit as real as an actual apple and emitting a fresh fruity tang, the fruit shimmers with a tantalizing red."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 110,
        "ActionId": 110,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            7
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 111,
        "ActionId": 111,
        "Type": 401,
