    {
        "Id": 119,
        "ActionId": 119,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "But before she knows it, the apple, seemingly having defied all common senses, has grown into an enormous maple tree—before it wilts and shrinks into a tiny little seed, all in the blink of an eye, and lies quietly in her hand."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 120,
        "ActionId": 120,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Wait, I don't... This is impossible. Is this some sort of illusion?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 121,
        "ActionId": 121,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Birth and death—everything there is in this world experiences the cycle.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 122,
        "ActionId": 122,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            5
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 123,
        "ActionId": 123,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "But it doesn't happen at this speed in the real world, which means...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 124,
        "ActionId": 124,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            7
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 125,
        "ActionId": 125,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "This is all a dream.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 126,
        "ActionId": 126,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With Hanying's eyes upon him, the man, without saying a word, looks back at her with a gentle smile."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 127,
        "ActionId": 127,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 128,
        "ActionId": 128,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "But how did I even get here without picking up a single sign...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 129,
        "ActionId": 129,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Wait, is it because of \"The Cradle\"?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 130,
        "ActionId": 130,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "That would be correct.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 131,
        "ActionId": 131,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And I take it that the same happened to Yoyo, too?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 132,
        "ActionId": 132,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "She passed by here three days ago, taking the path right up ahead.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 133,
        "ActionId": 133,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Without getting lost?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 134,
        "ActionId": 134,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "\"They\" seemed very interested in her, so they drew her toward the peak with a very straightforward path.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 135,
        "ActionId": 135,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "\"They\" as in \"The Cradle\"?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 136,
        "ActionId": 136,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The man shakes his head, not answering Hanying's question."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 137,
        "ActionId": 137,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Well... is there a way I can find her and leave this place, then?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 138,
        "ActionId": 138,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "That's where people go when they visit the mountain, and it's been that way since only heaven knows when.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 139,
        "ActionId": 139,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Past the peak, you'll find the answers you need to all the questions you have.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 140,
        "ActionId": 140,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 141,
        "ActionId": 141,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Can I help you with anything else?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 142,
        "ActionId": 142,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "What are you going to do?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 143,
        "ActionId": 143,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Me? Well, what exactly do you think this old man is going to do?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 144,
        "ActionId": 144,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "We came across nothing but modified mechanoids the entire way, and we didn't see a single human being until we met you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 145,
        "ActionId": 145,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And granted that this was all a dream, why are you telling me all this, though?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 146,
        "ActionId": 146,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Can I... really trust you?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 147,
        "ActionId": 147,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "That's for you to decide.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 148,
        "ActionId": 148,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Truth is but in the eye of the beholder—for a rose, by any other name, would smell just as sweet...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 149,
        "ActionId": 149,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The man reaches for the seed in Hanying's hand and takes it."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 150,
        "ActionId": 150,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "Let me keep this seed for you for now. We'll cross paths again.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 151,
        "ActionId": 151,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mi Ku",
            "And here \"they\" are...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 152,
        "ActionId": 152,
        "Type": 501,
        "Params": [
            "Assets/Product/Effect/Prefab/FxUi/FxUiStory/FxUiStoryShuju.prefab",
            "",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 153,
        "ActionId": 153,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The old man's body begins to digitalize—"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 154,
        "ActionId": 154,
        "Type": 505,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Effect/Prefab/FxUi/FxUiStory/FxUiStoryShuju.prefab",
