        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 161,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "Having been keeping an eye on the scene this entire time, Spooner wastes no time rushing up to Hanying—except when he gets there, the man who's been sitting on the rock is now nowhere to be seen."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 162,
        "ActionId": 162,
        "Type": 505,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Assets/Product/Effect/Prefab/FxTongyong/FxUiGuanbixiaoshi.prefab"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 163,
        "ActionId": 163,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500629,
            12,
            400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 164,
        "ActionId": 164,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            2,
            500490,
            4,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 165,
        "ActionId": 165,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Hanying",
            "I'm fine, Spooner.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Totally knew we were up against something!",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 167,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "This place... isn't real, if what the man said was true.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 168,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "What do you mean?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 169,
        "ActionId": 169,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 170,
        "ActionId": 170,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "The man...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 171,
        "ActionId": 171,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Showed me that what happens here can go beyond our understanding of how things work in the real world...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 172,
        "ActionId": 172,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And that we might have walked right into this trap that \"The Cradle\" set up from the get-go without knowing it.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 173,
        "ActionId": 173,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And I gather that means we're in some sort of virtual world?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 174,
        "ActionId": 174,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "I know how crazy that sounds, but I think that's what's happening.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 175,
        "ActionId": 175,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "There is no way to prove one way or the other, though!",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 176,
        "ActionId": 176,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "I mean, if this entire thing has been a trap from the get-go...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 177,
        "ActionId": 177,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Then this is probably a place where reality and virtuality blend into each other, like in a dream.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 178,
        "ActionId": 178,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 179,
        "ActionId": 179,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Does it count as a dream, though? Because, theoretically speaking, mechanoids don't dream.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 180,
        "ActionId": 180,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Our neural circuit that runs on minimum power is the closest thing we have to what a human would call a \"dream.\"",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 181,
        "ActionId": 181,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 182,
        "ActionId": 182,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Have you never had a dream?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 183,
        "ActionId": 183,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Never.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 184,
        "ActionId": 184,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "I'd been in one myself—until \"Sage\" woke up me from it.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 185,
        "ActionId": 185,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And all those days that Yoyo and I spent together on the Nighter seem like a dream to me from yesterday.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 186,
        "ActionId": 186,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Mechanoids and dreaming. Now, that's unheard of.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 187,
        "ActionId": 187,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Everything seemed real in that dream I was in.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 188,
        "ActionId": 188,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And I probably knew that it was just a dream somewhere deep down.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 189,
        "ActionId": 189,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Still... I wasn't able to wake myself up from it. Well, I guess it's more like I didn't want to wake up from it.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 190,
        "ActionId": 190,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "...Had you ever seen Sage before then? Or any of her work?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 191,
        "ActionId": 191,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Never. The only thing I'd heard about her was that she was able to enlighten mechanoids and give us what they call a \"heart.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 192,
        "ActionId": 192,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Which means you awoke solely by living with that little girl—without having ever met Sage.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 193,
        "ActionId": 193,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Mankind's records say that dreams show one's consciousness very vividly.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 194,
        "ActionId": 194,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "It's only when a machine has awakened that it becomes aware of the \"self\"— and with that realization comes consciousness.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 195,
        "ActionId": 195,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And that \"consciousness,\" in other words, is the \"heart.\"",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 196,
        "ActionId": 196,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            7
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 197,
        "ActionId": 197,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "So that... is the \"heart.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 198,
        "ActionId": 198,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "You're the first one I came across at the Church that describes their consciousness as \"dreams\"...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 199,
        "ActionId": 199,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And it's something we've only heard a handful of times even from Sage herself...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 200,
        "ActionId": 200,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Spooner's words seem to be pointing at only one thing now..."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 201,
        "ActionId": 201,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And if you truly had awakened by that point... then that's when you had a \"heart.\"",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 202,
        "ActionId": 202,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            12
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 203,
        "ActionId": 203,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "That's what Cervantes said to me, too, back at the Church.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 204,
        "ActionId": 204,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Except... I have no idea how to prove that, and Arcana had no way to prove this part that they call the \"heart.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 205,
        "ActionId": 205,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Or... maybe that's not something that needs to be proven to begin with.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 206,
        "ActionId": 206,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Spooner shakes his head in confusion."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 207,
        "ActionId": 207,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "I haven't quite wrapped my head around all of these just yet.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 208,
        "ActionId": 208,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "But... do you trust the man?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 209,
        "ActionId": 209,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "For what it's worth, he might have just been something that \"The Cradle\" tried to bait us with.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 210,
        "ActionId": 210,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "I don't think he's a fabulist... given his peaceful and insightful tone.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 211,
        "ActionId": 211,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And there was something he intentionally left unspoken throughout the entire conversation—all while we both knew perfectly well that he was withholding something.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 212,
        "ActionId": 212,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "Strange indeed.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 213,
        "ActionId": 213,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "\"The Cradle\" could have just turned this place into a maze and never let us leave, had they really wanted us to suffer.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 214,
        "ActionId": 214,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "Except the man said, \"Truth is but in the eye of the beholder.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 215,
        "ActionId": 215,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hanying",
            "And that, to me, sounded like we could make our way out of here with whatever path we think would be able to get us out of here.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 216,
        "ActionId": 216,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Spooner",
            "And that's all we need to do... to get out of here? I mean, that sounds almost too easy to me.",
            2
        ]
